{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_st03","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_st03","title":"请君入瓮","storyCode":"DH-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"eb24fbdeab22c51133cef1838e976e6bab8dab4ce9eb5092163921e63cf363cb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，下面的人让我告诉你，准备都做好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？爸爸，你好像不怎么高兴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？爸爸不是等这一天等了很久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉是个难缠的女人，不到最后一刻都不能放松警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果情况不对，你就让埃内斯托那小子带你跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？我要和爸爸在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别任性。本来，这件事就不该把你卷进来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老皮尤要是知道他托付给我的女儿跟着我干这个，怕是要从坟墓里爬起来宰了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于埃内斯托那小子......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子以为我看不出来，他那点心思，我怎么可能看不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥没有背叛哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，没有这小子，这事成不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他其实不想这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁不想吃好喝好睡好，不去想那些有的没的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"潘乔揉了揉站在身边的养女的头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘乔","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，乖，去把我的烟斗拿来，我要一个人静一静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林小姐呢，我以为她会和你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你不打算掩饰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，都到了这份上，我也没有什么掩饰的必要了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实没有想到，你们居然这样都能突破出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是小看了你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我很好奇，你们是怎么发现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞在第一轮就发现了你们在安装炸药，只是我们没有告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那时候，我就被怀疑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候只是以防万一罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们确认你有问题，是因为在你的武器店里发现了同样的炸药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到胜负在这么早就分出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在是什么意思，垂死挣扎？还是想要自首？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有一些话想说，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听完或许你会有不同的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洗耳恭听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，你知道玻利瓦尔的历史吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎么清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，你过去是在维多利亚留学，维多利亚没有怎么插手玻利瓦尔的事，想来不特意调查的话不会知道得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亚发现这片土地之前，这里只是一片叫做玻利瓦尔的平原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚人在这里发现了许多源石矿脉，于是他们驻足于此，将这里变成了他们的附属地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，因为种种原因，伊比利亚的统治终结了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过混乱的一百三十年后，莱塔尼亚人来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是玻利瓦尔又成为了莱塔尼亚的附属地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两百年前，玻利瓦尔从附属地演变成了附属国，也就是辛嘉斯王朝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以说，玻利瓦尔是从那个时候才成为了现在的玻利瓦尔——虽然辛嘉斯王朝的人从不自称玻利瓦尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，巫王时期，莱塔尼亚试图通过玻利瓦尔在哥伦比亚掀起内乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这么做的结果却是，内乱不仅失败，玻利瓦尔反被哥伦比亚入侵，联合政府就是在那时候建立的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦尔从此进入了哥伦比亚和莱塔尼亚割据的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚对于玻利瓦尔并没有那么上心，而哥伦比亚虽然野心勃勃却也没有办法一口吞下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"双方于是进入了拉锯状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而后，再也无法忍受这种状态的玻利瓦尔人选择了反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们成立了反抗军，自称真正玻利瓦尔人，并立誓将玻利瓦尔变成真正独立的国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，事情并没有好转，真正玻利瓦尔人的建立只是将玻利瓦尔拖入更深的泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，玻利瓦尔变成了现在这副样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联合政府，辛嘉斯王朝，真正玻利瓦尔人，三方陷入了永无止境的战火之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，在这样的环境中，诞生了多索雷斯这样一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在坎黛拉女士的治理下，这座城市不仅在三方政府中都吃得开，而且甚至很多时候三方都要卖坎黛拉女士人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这座城市坐拥他们无法忽视的资源，而且坎黛拉女士手上也有足够的力量保护这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市于是逐渐成为了玻利瓦尔人人都向往的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一个饱受战火折磨的玻利瓦尔人，心中的梦想都是攒钱来这里玩，甚至是在这里翻身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，像你和林小姐这样的好人一定是明白的，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市是一个怎样的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果说三方政府至少还有统一玻利瓦尔的心思，那坎黛拉女士则毫无这方面的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说白了吧，陈小姐，这座城市的繁荣建立在整个玻利瓦尔的痛苦之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它越繁荣，这个国家就越没有希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是许多真正热爱玻利瓦尔这片土地的人无法接受的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是其中一员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这座城市不应该存在于玻利瓦尔这样的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的目的是毁掉这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，毁掉的话，太浪费了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的目的是制造恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你说这些是想说服我帮助你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢，用几句话就说服别人加入自己，我还没那么有自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我希望你和林小姐能够至少袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们应该能够发现，我们的事业堪称正义，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要两位不出手，我保证我的人不会对两位出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位很强大，这一点，跟着两位一路参加比赛的我感受最为深刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和两位起冲突的话，会带来许多不必要的损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你和林小姐能够考虑这个提案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃内斯托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在不久以前，经历过一场比这一次要复杂得多的阴谋，在那场阴谋中，我除了认清了自己的弱小，没有获得任何东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我至少还是敢这么断言——没有一种给他人带去恐惧的东西，可以自称正义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你没有说实话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂你在说什么，陈小姐，我已经承认了我是这次的主谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我起疑的是你将我们困在你的武器店这个行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这虽然相当有效，但也相当勉强，我认为你不会不去考虑暴露自己身份的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我开始思考，你会不会还有后手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你是这一切的幕后主使，如果你的身份暴露，那我想不到有什么后手可以补救这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我想到了，如果你的身份并不那么重要，也就是说，其实你暴露了也无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，那就说得通了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，能够困住我们最好，但如果困不住而且暴露了，那也不过是变成现在这样的局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我站在你的面前，将你当做这一切的主使，而无法看清你背后的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在，我也依然身在你的局中，是这样吧，埃内斯托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正身在局中的人，是不会说出这样的话的，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我们掌握的情报太少，以至于即使我知道这是一个局，我也必须跳进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，仅凭着少得可怜的线索，就能在这短短一周里差一点抓到我们精心策划几年的计划核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，你和林小姐还是太厉害了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，有许多人说我太小题大做，将两位当成了自己的主要对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但从我的角度来说，我很庆幸我这么做了，否则，要是我疏忽一点，多泄露一些东西，两位就已经发现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，两位还是失败了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃内斯托说着，打开了电视。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
